  "notes": "USAGE:\n{勝|か}ち{取|と}る implies a hard-won achievement. The object is typically something abstract and valuable such as a victory, rights, trust, or a position.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {優勝|ゆうしょう}を{勝|か}ち{取|と}る (to win the championship)\n- {信頼|しんらい}を{勝|か}ち{取|と}る (to earn trust)\n- {自由|じゆう}を{勝|か}ち{取|と}る (to win freedom)\n- {契約|けいやく}を{勝|か}ち{取|と}る (to win a contract)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}). Transitive. The object takes the particle を.",
